gory="Header" data-matomo-action="Menu" data-matomo-name="Onderwerpen" data-v-c051a2cc>Onderwerpen</a></li><li class="relative" data-v-c051a2cc><a href="/contact" class="inline-block p-5 leading-4 text-white-500 theme-logged-in:text-blue-500 hover:text-white-500 hover:bg-blue-700 theme-logged-in:hover:bg-logged-in-100 h-[3.75rem]" data-matomo-category="Header" data-matomo-action="Menu" data-matomo-name="Contact" data-v-c051a2cc>Contact</a></li><!--]--></ul></nav></header><!--]--><span></span><!----><main id="main-content" class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-x-0 bg-white-500 pt-8 gap-y-12"><!--[--><!----><!--[--><!--[--><div class="grid-cols-1 !gap-y-0 wide lg:grid-cols-12"><div class="lg:col-start-3 lg:col-span-8"><h1 data-testid="title" class="col-span-12 mb-4 title">Wanneer bel ik 0900-8844?</h1><div class="overflow-hidden html-block col-span-12" data-testid="introduction" data-v-2147862e><p>Geen spoed, wel politie? Bel dan 0900-8844!</p>

<p>Op dit nummer kunt u terecht met al uw niet-spoedeisende vragen en problemen. 0900-8844 is 7 dagen per week 24 uur per dag bereikbaar. Belt u met 0900-8844 of 144 dan betaalt u 2 cent per minuut, plus uw gebruikelijke belkosten.</p></div></div></div><div class="-mb-12 grid gap-y-12"><!--[--><!--[--><!----><div><!----><div class="col-span-12 full py-8 bg-theme-background-alt theme-logged-in:bg-logged-in-10 col-span-12" data-testid="actie-blok" id="action-block"><div class="lg:grid-cols-12 wide"><div class="lg:col-start-3 lg:col-span-8 flex flex-col gap-8"><div class="urgent-wrapper"><div class="grid grid-cols-2 col-span-12 buttons-grid md:gap-x-5 gap-x-0 gap-y-4"><!--[--><!--[--><h2 data-testid="phone-number-1-title" class="column-start-1 col-span-2 mb-0 md:col-span-1 md:row-start-1">Bel de politie</h2><!----><span></span><!--]--><!--]--></div></div><!----></div></div></div></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!--]--><!--]--></div><!----><div class="grid-cols-1 !gap-y-0 wide lg:grid-cols-12"><div class="lg:col-start-3 lg:col-span-8"><h2 data-testid="title" class="col-span-12 mb-4 title">Hoort bij onderwerp</h2><div data-testid="list-container" class="mb-5 break-inside-avoid"><!----><ul class="pl-2" data-testid="list-items" data-v-42adab2c><!--[--><li class="mb-1 group" data-v-42adab2c><a data-matomo-action="Gerelateerd onderwerp" data-matomo-name="Contact met 0900-8844 (24/7 bereikbaar)" href="/onderwerpen/contact-met-0900-8844-24-7-bereikbaar.html" class="flex items-start text-theme-primary-color group visited:text-purple-500" data-v-42adab2c><i class="ic-chevron-right icon-size-16 icon-color-primary flex-shrink-0 mt-1 mr-4 group-visited:bg-purple-500" aria-hidden="true" data-v-42adab2c></i><span data-v-42adab2c>Contact met 0900-8844 (24/7 bereikbaar)</span></a></li><!--]--></ul></div></div></div><div class="grid-cols-1 !gap-y-0 wide lg:grid-cols-12 mb-12"><div class="lg:col-start-3 lg:col-span-8"><div id="ShareBlock" class="items-center lg:fle